  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 5 × 4 + 2 - 6 ÷ 3 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **+**\n **×**\n **-**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **×**\n **+**\n **÷**\n **-**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 5 + 4 × 2 ÷ 6 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 + __**4 × 2**__ ÷ 6 - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 + __**8 ÷ 6**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 + __**1.33**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**5 + 1.33**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**6.33 - 3**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**3.33**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
